[Cookbook:Lime|lime]] juice\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* [[Cookbook:Cornmeal|Cornmeal]]\n* [[Cookbook:Poultry Shake|Poultry shake]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]], beaten\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Smoky Chipotle Hot Sauce|chipotle hot sauce]]\n* 5 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], smashed and [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]]\n* 4–5 drops red [[Cookbook:Food Coloring|food coloring]]\n* [[Cookbook:Oil and Fat|Oil]] for [[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|deep frying]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Dip chicken in beaten eggs. Season liberally with poultry shake.\n#[[Cookbook:Dredging|Dredge]] chicken in cornmeal. Let rest 2–3 minutes.\n#[[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|Deep fry]] in batches at 350°F (175°C) for 11–12 minutes. Drain on a [[Cookbook:Cooling Rack|cooling rack]].\n#Meanwhile, combine remaining ingredients in a large nonreactive bowl. Add wings and [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|toss]] to coat. Serve warm.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken wing]]\n[[Category:Appetizer recipes]]\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lime juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornmeal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chipotle chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using food coloring]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hot sauce]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Honey Lime Chicken Wings","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"32 chicken wingettes","sourceText":"32 chicken wingettes","amountText":"32 chicken wingettes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ cup freshly-squeezed lime juice","sourceText":"½ cup freshly-squeezed lime juice","amountText":"½ cup freshly-squeezed lime juice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 Tbsp honey","sourceText":"3 Tbsp honey","amountText":"3 Tbsp honey","amount":null,"unit":null,"foo